WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.124
Open the app's Analytics page. Total Uses, Total
Discount Given and Orders Affected describe recorded

2
00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:10.616
discount activity; Active Campaigns describes
configuration. These are not interchangeable measures

3
00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:18.373
of conversion. Our demo has one active campaign and no
processed discount orders, so No data yet is expected.

4
00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:26.539
We do not create a customer order just to fill a
chart. A dash means missing reported data, not an

5
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:27.764
estimated revenue figure.

6
00:00:28.814 --> 00:00:35.255
Use Campaign Performance to compare the reported uses,
discount amount and last-used information for each

7
00:00:35.255 --> 00:00:41.696
campaign. The page explains that data comes from
processed orders and that historical orders before

8
00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:48.995
installation are not included. Adding products to a
cart or opening checkout is not an order-use record.

9
00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:56.295
For a disputed result, compare the saved campaign,
actual order lines and applied discounts. Do not treat

10
00:00:56.295 --> 00:01:01.447
this table as session replay, acquisition attribution
or proof of incremental sales.

11
00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:07.087
In Plans and Billing, choose by the number
of campaigns you need active at once.

12
00:01:07.331 --> 00:01:12.803
Every MTD plan includes the standard campaign tools,
including gifts and discount codes.

13
00:01:13.047 --> 00:01:16.140
Free includes one active campaign for new stores.

14
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:20.393
Starter includes ten. Pro and Plus
have no app-level campaign cap.

15
00:01:20.637 --> 00:01:25.208
An enabled campaign uses a slot
even before its scheduled start.

16
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:28.947
Drafts, stopped campaigns,
and expired campaigns do not count.

17
00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:35.117
MTD Plus is the app plan. Shopify Plus
is the store's platform plan.

18
00:01:35.117 --> 00:01:36.763
They are separate subscriptions.

19
00:01:37.023 --> 00:01:41.374
Storefront cart mystery is available
on every MTD plan.

20
00:01:41.374 --> 00:01:46.207
Checkout mystery requires MTD Plus,
an eligible Shopify Plus store,

21
00:01:46.207 --> 00:01:49.107
proper permissions, and a supported setup.

22
00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:51.074
This is a development store.

23
00:01:51.074 --> 00:01:55.511
No paid subscription is active here,
and we are not approving a charge.

24
00:01:55.771 --> 00:01:58.436
Check the current terms in Shopify before upgrading.

25
00:01:58.436 --> 00:02:02.101
Choose enough room for the offers
you need to run together,

26
00:02:02.101 --> 00:02:04.433
and test them in cart and checkout.
